<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Connect <%= provider.name %> · StockChief</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/commercial.css"><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui;background:#f5f4fb;color:#27243e;margin:0}main{max-width:480px;margin:40px auto;padding:26px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px}h1{font-size:25px;line-height:1.25}a,button{display:block;margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font:inherit}button{width:100%;background:#6546e8;color:#fff;border:0;cursor:pointer}a{color:#563bd2;border:1px solid #dedbea;text-decoration:none}label{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px}.brand{color:#563bd2;font-weight:700}.hint{font-size:14px;color:#625d73}@media(max-width:540px){main{margin:16px;padding:20px}}</style><link rel="stylesheet" href="/professional-system.css?v=<%= locals.assetVersion||'current' %>">
</head><body><main><div class="brand">StockChief</div><h1>Connect <%= provider.name %> test account</h1><p>The configured <%= provider.name %> app uses its sandbox. This test environment needs a signed-in test account before its authorization page can open.</p><p><%= prerequisite.message %></p><a href="<%= prerequisite.href %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= prerequisite.label %></a><form method="get" action="<%= launchPath %>"><input type="hidden" name="ticket" value="<%= ticket %>"><input type="hidden" name="popup" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="providerSetupReady" value="1"><label><input type="checkbox" required> The test-account dashboard is open in this same browser.</label><button type="submit">Continue to <%= provider.name %></button></form><p class="hint">For normal live-account sign-in, the application administrator must configure this provider’s production OAuth app. Your existing test connections are preserved.</p><a href="/settings/connections" target="_top">Return to StockChief</a></main></body></html>
